    {
      "name": "Freezing Mist Breath",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "cold",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The frost drake spits a ball of liquid up to 60 feet that explodes into a 20ft Burst cloud of freezing mist. Those in the burst take 8d6 Cold Damage damage (Basic DC 25 Reflex Saving Throw save).</p>\n<p>The frost drake can't use Freezing Mist Breath again for 1d6 rounds, during which the mist cakes all surfaces in the area with a sheet of slippery ice that turns the area into difficult terrain.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
